ts of the GDP were R$22,813.47 or US$11.521,95 in nominal terms, and Int$14,537.40 in PPP terms. The'\n\t[68] link 'Brazilian population'\n\tStaticText ', in 2012, was 193,300,291, ranking'\n\t[69] link '5th'\n\tStaticText \"worldwide and totaling 2.84% of the world's population.\"\n[73] image ''\n[75] paragraph ''\n\tStaticText 'Brazil is formed by the union of 27 federative units—'\n\t[76] link '26 states'\n\tStaticText 'and the'\n\t[77] link 'Federal District'\n\tStaticText ', which contains the capital city,'\n\t[78] link 'Brasília'\n\tStaticText '. Of these, seven states;'\n\t[79] link 'São Paulo'\n\tStaticText ','\n\t[80] link 'Rio de Janeiro'\n\tStaticText ','\n\t[81] link 'Minas Gerais'\n\tStaticText ','\n\t[82] link 'Rio Grande do Sul'\n\tStaticText ','\n\t[83] link 'Paraná'\n\tStaticText ','\n\t[84] link 'Bahia'\n\tStaticText 'and'\n\t[85] link 'Santa Catarina'\n\tStaticText '; with the Federal District, constitute almost 80% of the national economy. São Paulo is the richest and most populous state in Brazil, ranking'\n\t[86] link '16th'\n\tStaticText 'and 27th worldwide, respectively; Rio de Janeiro is the second richest and the third most populous state, ranking 65th and 59th worldwide; Minas Gerais is the third richest and the second most populous state, ranking 80th and 55th worldwide.'\n\t[87] link 'Piauí'\n\tStaticText 'has the lowest'\n\t[88] link 'GRP'\n\tStaticText 'per capita at the same time that the Federal District has the highest.'\n\t[89] link 'Amapá'\n\tStaticText ','\n\t[90] link 'Acre'\n\tStaticText 'and'\n\t[91] link 'Roraima'\n\tStaticText 'are the poorest states in the country with 0.59% of the national GDP.'\n[93] DisclosureTriangle 'Listings', expanded=True\n\t[94] heading 'Listings'\n[97] link '[]'\n\tStaticText '['\n\tStaticText '1'\n\tStaticText ']'\n[99] link 'Brazilian Institute of Geography and Statistics'\nStaticText '['\nStaticText '2'\nStaticText ']'", "last_screenshot_path": "trajectories/screenshots/visualwebarena/GenericAgent-anthropic_claude-3.7-sonnet/visualwebarena.resized.280/screenshot_step_30.png"}